Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep runnin' along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch as we pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As we raise our flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, here we go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing through the endless ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep\Nbelieving in our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And let our heart lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All there's left is to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll link our hearts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Still raising our flag as we journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't back down from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams\Nwhile keeping the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep heading for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes,\Nwhat we'll have to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories will stay in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, a lion shows no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Its fury remains for no creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew taking that second\Nrumble ball was a gamble,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was hoping it wouldn't be this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I have seven different forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that means I only have a 14 %\Nchance of getting arm point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But as long as I can move,\NI'll try as many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,as it takes that's right\Ni have to keep fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm point!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm point! You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times is this going to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's about to give out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get arm point now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo-yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo-yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Beware yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your final attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Glo-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chouchou finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my only chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.82,0:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloven!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Race Michietti!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That has to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my strongest attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid, ape, beautiful,\Ncherry blossom, blizzard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have awakened the wrath of heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the thunder of the lions roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick! Lotus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the strength\Nto fight back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, what in the world\Ndid you do out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't gonna cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky no one died.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,While you've been here sleeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole country's been in an\Nuproar about what you did last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I did something really bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire village almost got wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you love your experiments\Njust like your old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but you have to plan these things\Nvery carefully before you jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole village wiped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't think it at first, but you're\Nthe spitting image of that crazy quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:06:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help but\Ncause a ruckus, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Dr. E.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't do it again,\Nso don't kick me out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.94,0:06:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and get better already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,These chores aren't gonna do themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Life return!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffer as you must, but do not cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For if you shed a tear, thy\Nname as a man shall suffer too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Far behind you is the peaceful mountain\Nvillage where the cicadas sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sweet memories leaping in your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,have given way to the\Ndancing flames of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Licking at your feet with every\Nstep of your final journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I give to you the leaves of a willow tree
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,dyed in crimson to honor your parting now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,take it take it and\Nnever look back see the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,leaves fluttering in\NRed Song of the Willow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He escaped from the Hermine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dr. E.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to die\Nanyway, I have to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to lose control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I used three rumble balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I don't know,\NI lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you could say\Nyour Devil Fruit went wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let yourself go down that path.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A power that destroys your foes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but turns you against your\Nfriends and your own body as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one word\Nfor a creature like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh doesn't even matter that I'm super right\Nnow this week has kicked my ass? Ragged
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,walking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,away with his key number
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,four huh don't the\Nswordsman in the nose need
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,number two that's what\Nthe deer said if this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,guy at number four and that guy at number
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, well that narrows things down some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that can only mean that\Nsecretary looking gal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,has the number two key I better hurry up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and find her those guys\Nreally need my help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression\Nthat you were short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If that were the case, it would\Nseem you aren't trying very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps this is all part of your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you mock me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to wait for me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle has already started, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrogant, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you ate a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So that bath is disabling your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If your body's half-submerged, I\Ncan't imagine you can do much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm so cocky I'd drop my guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without my powers, I'm\Nstill better off than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what the hell did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It would spoil it if I told you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Solving that mystery is part of\Nthe fun of fighting a powerholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was that happened to Sanji,\Nshe's obviously the one who's behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to be careful, otherwise\NI'll end up just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally starting to\Nget some strength back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.72,0:11:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think I'm weak, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you haven't seen the\Nperfect climb attack yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm just a pretty\Nface, you're in for a world of hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can move my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Free my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an impressive weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd just lie\Nthere and let you stomp on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my thunderbolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tupo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what happens when\Nyou don't take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What an interesting surprise I never\Nthought I'd get struck by lightning indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.54,0:12:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that barrier protected\Nher but what was it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,made of it looked like\Nit turned into bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hurry and figure that out\Nit's your only chance of defeating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't tease you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was almost like soap\Nwhen you washed it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you eat some kind\Nof bubble bubble fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, still,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,even if you do know what my power does,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean you're\Nstronger than me or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost feel bad for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it one way, my\Npower is cleanliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a soap human, thanks\Nto the bubble bubble fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so my entire body produces a lather.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely, isn't it? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I had a secretary like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm talking like an old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it seems pretty useless\Nfor fighting, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So what, do you make people slip?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea of bubbles that I\Ncreate obey my every command,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have quite the imagination. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So she wasn't just taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bubble master, soap sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the fluffy appearance fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheep cloud, relaxing bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,by the way, didn't you wonder why you lost\Nyour strength when you walked in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have had something\Nto do with her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nwhen I came through the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.74,0:14:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The floor was covered with bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You took too long to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My strength is fading again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:15:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like earlier when I\Nstepped on that puddle of bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll soon understand the\Ntrue horror of this power.?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubbles that come\Nfrom my body are thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They scour and clean\Nanything you can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirt and general filth, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As well as your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you need to be\Nreminded of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not just a secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the world's\Nmost deadly assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because the\Nbubbles disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with your crap. Thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That weapon is interesting,\Nbut it won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs, I can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lightest touch can\Nmake anything glistened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my gift to make everything beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give your skin a luminescent sheen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Every inch of your body\Nwill shimmer from my touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in a man's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in a man's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in a man's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he encounters a foe that\Nhis honor demands he face,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,even though it might result in his demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Domestic Lotus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry out, Song of Willow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no idea what kind of\Nchunk is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I get back up,\NI better get me some cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that deer is\Nstill hanging in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's the CP9 guy that\Ngot locked in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's holding him like a ragdoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's the same style\Nthat deer was wearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not that deer gorilla, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kumadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,His body came rocketing\Nover from the Tower of Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But who could have done that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what the hell is this problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember telling\Nyou to stop, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget who's the boss here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just drag her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull her by the hair if you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Start walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're delusional, aren't you? Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're honestly convinced that the Straw\NHats are still on their way to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a\Nweak-looking pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's your only\Nhope, that's pretty sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:21:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That explosion we heard earlier was\Nprobably the pipes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they\Ncould make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're up in your little fantasy\Nworld dreaming of being rescued,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll pass the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.04,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bridge of Hesitation lies\Nright before the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cross the first\Nelevated half of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and once the gates are within our sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The other half of the bridge\Nwill rise from the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we'll finally pass\Nthrough the gates themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the gates are firmly closed behind\Nus, every lingering trace of your pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,misguided optimism will\Nbe dashed to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll forget what hope even means.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The only feeling left in your body will be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,an overwhelming and\Neternal sense of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You will spend your days in ceaseless\Natonement for your arrogant crime of existing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's true, Nico. Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, hurry along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your feet, wench.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,ROBIN! ROBIN!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.66,0:22:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.49,0:22:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You better take Nico\NRobin and start moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The door!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,At least it doesn't look like\Nit's made of iron this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's big in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you, pigeon bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it.
